  {
   "id": "sophstar-157973@major-2022-03-01",
   "gameId": "sophstar-157973",
   "displayName": "1.05C Update",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2022-03-01T15:05:42.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "The 1.05C update went very silent, but we guessed some people may be wondered why it exists.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We actually jumped from A to C version, because some corrections were done so quickly we didn't even upload them to Steam.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We fixed a bug with the game crashing in Level 5 cutscene, which begun to happen with 1.05 version (It stayed on the game for less than 8 hours :D )",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We made some minor optimizations so the game ran with using less GPU resources. The game is insanely light as it is, but we had a couple of reports of stuttering mainly when using a recording/streaming program like OBS Studio and we hope this is gone by now.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We optimized the C64 and \"Famines\" filters so they don't slowdown the game on older machines.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We made a few changes regarding the Linux version (still beta-testing, but it's coming up!)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "That's it, We are sure most people wouldn't even have noticed those small changes :)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
