       "text": "We just updated the game with lots of new border options! Most of them now fit the whole screen on every resolution.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Update your version and choose your favourite one!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
